ِ","N","stem","MP|GEN"]]},{"e":"٥","v":"11:5"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"10:107","t":"And if Allāh should touch you with adversity, there is no remover of it except Him; and if He intends for you good, then there is no repeller of His bounty. He causes it to reach whom He wills of His servants. And He is the Forgiving, the Merciful.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":107,"sd":null},{"k":"10:108","t":"Say, \"O mankind, the truth has come to you from your Lord, so whoever is guided is only guided for [the benefit of] his soul, and whoever goes astray only goes astray [in violation] against it. And I am not over you a manager.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":108,"sd":null},{"k":"10:109","t":"And follow what is revealed to you, [O Muḥammad], and be patient until Allāh will judge. And He is the best of judges.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":109,"sd":null},{"k":"11:1","t":"Alif, Lām, Rā. [This is] a Book whose verses are perfected and then presented in detail from [one who is] Wise and Aware","j":11,"h":22,"s":11,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"11:2","t":"[Through a messenger, saying], \"Do not worship except Allāh. Indeed, I am to you from Him a warner and a bringer of good tidings,\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":11,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"11:3","t":"And [saying], \"Seek forgiveness of your Lord and repent to Him, [and] He will let you enjoy a good provision for a specified term and give every doer of favor his favor [i.e., reward]. But if you turn away, then indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a great Day.","j":11,"h":22,"s":11,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"11:4","t":"To Allāh is your return, and He is over all things competent.\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":11,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"11:5","t":"Unquestionably, they [i.e., the disbelievers] turn away their breasts to hide themselves from him. Unquestionably, [even] when they cover themselves in their clothing, He [i.e., Allāh] knows what they conceal and what they declare. Indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts.","j":11,"h":22,"s":11,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10,11],"sajdah":false}